# Rendered document pages and spreadsheets.
#
# This working folder accumulates output from unrelated tasks — page renders of
# internal documents, timesheets, scratch build scripts. None of it belongs in
# the repository, and the existing rules did not stop it: .pdf was blocked but
# .png renders of the same pages were not, and .xlsx was not blocked at all. A
# single "git add ." would have published an employee's hours into a repo that
# outside developers now have access to.
#
# No .png or .xlsx is tracked, so these patterns cost the project nothing. Use
# "git add -f" for a file that genuinely belongs here, such as a UI asset.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.xlsx
*.xls
__pycache__/
*.pyc
work/
qa_*/
build_part11_*.py
